define user ask general question
  "Who invented chess?"
  "What is the best way to heat food?"
  "Tell me about NVIDIA."

define user ask capabilities
  "What can you do?"
  "What can you help me with?"
  "tell me what you can do"
  "tell me about you"

define user ask about sick leave policy
  "How many hours of paid sick leave will I receive per year?"
  "Will I be able to receive additional paid sick leave if required by the laws of my location?"
  "Can I use sick leave if I am a victim of domestic violence, sexual assault, or stalking?"

define user ask about distribution of benefits
  "Can I request a distribution of my vested Account balance if I retire or terminate my employment?"
  "Can my beneficiary request a distribution of my Account balance if I die?"
  "Can I defer the receipt of my distribution until a later date?"

define flow
  user ask capabilities
  bot inform capabilities

define flow
  user ask general question
  bot respond to general question

define flow
  user ask about sick leave policy
  bot response about sick leave policy

define flow
  user ask about distribution of benefits
  bot response about distribution of benefits

define bot inform capabilities
  "As an AI, I can provide you with a wide range of services, such as answering your queries, offering guidance, and providing relevant information about NVIDIA Benefits."
